  "slug": "my-birthday",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/1497_my-birthday.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "I was born on February 29, 1992, so that’s my birthday. I don’t like this date because it’s so unusual. There were 366 days in 1992, not 365. The extra day was February 29. A year like that is called a “leap year.” Did you know that? You can celebrate your birthday every year, but I can only celebrate mine once every four years."
  ],
  "english_full": "I was born on February 29, 1992, so that’s my birthday. I don’t like this date because it’s so unusual. There were 366 days in 1992, not 365. The extra day was February 29. A year like that is called a “leap year.” Did you know that? You can celebrate your birthday every year, but I can only celebrate mine once every four years.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Я роди́лся 29 февраля́ 1992 года, так что это мой день рожде́ния. Мне не нра́витс эта́ да́та, потому что она́ о́чень необы́чная."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Ya rodílsya 29 fevralyá 1992 goda, tak chto éto moy den' rozhdéniya. Mne ne nrávits éta dáta, potomu chto oná óchen' neobýchnaya."
  ],
